WEBVTT

00:08:27.461 --> 00:08:30.798
He also knew that these warriors

00:08:30.839 --> 00:08:33.926
had never been brought
to the decision-making table.

00:08:33.926 --> 00:08:36.845
And so he brought them, and he said,

00:08:36.887 --> 00:08:39.348
"Instead of us tracking
lions to kill them,

00:08:39.348 --> 00:08:44.728
let us track lions and then tell
every other herder where these lions are,

00:08:44.770 --> 00:08:47.356
so that livestock are safe

00:08:47.356 --> 00:08:48.732
and lions are safe.

00:08:48.774 --> 00:08:50.818
And they can share the space.”

00:08:50.818 --> 00:08:55.072
And it is through Jeneria's
Warrior Watch program

00:08:55.072 --> 00:08:58.951
that he has worked with these warriors
as conservation leaders,

00:08:58.993 --> 00:09:02.329
and they have saved lions
hundreds of times in this way.